Package: ddd-qtify
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gdb
Provides: ddd
Conflicts: ddd
Replaces: ddd
Description: DDD, the GNU Data Display Debugger, built on Qt
 DDD is a graphical front end for gdb and other command-line debuggers,
 with a source window, a debugger console and a graph of data displays.
 This package builds its unmodified Motif and Athena source against Motif
 on Qt: it runs as a Qt application (X11 or Wayland) without libXm,
 libXaw, libXt or libX11.
